+From ac73b30f5ac97bb243704b358c005f0ec6d43557 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: "Mohamed R. Khalil" <m.radwan.khalil@gmail.com>
+Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 20:25:11 +0300
+Subject: [PATCH] fix(session): drop assistant messages with no provider
+ content (empty-assistant-guard)
+
+Strict providers (Kimi) reject assistant messages carrying no content with
+400 "must not be empty", permanently wedging the session: every retry
+persists another error husk and the session can never send again. The
+conversion only guarded parts.length > 0, so messages with only step-start
+or empty-text parts shipped as empty provider messages. Now a message is
+emitted only when it contributes non-empty text, a tool call, or non-empty
+reasoning. The Anthropic signed-reasoning separator shape stays eligible
+through its reasoning parts.
